{"verse_key": "21:63", "surah": 21, "verse": 63, "text_uthmani": "قَالَ بَلْ فَعَلَهُۥ كَبِيرُهُمْ هَـٰذَا فَسْـَٔلُوهُمْ إِن كَانُوا۟ يَنطِقُونَ", "translation": "He said, \"Rather, this - the largest of them - did it, so ask them, if they should [be able to] speak.\"", "verse_from_ms": 970830, "verse_to_ms": 983760, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/21.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "قَالَ", "start_ms": 970830, "end_ms": 972170}, {"i": 1, "text": "بَلْ", "start_ms": 972170, "end_ms": 972480}, {"i": 2, "text": "فَعَلَهُۥ", "start_ms": 972480, "end_ms": 973580}, {"i": 3, "text": "كَبِيرُهُمْ", "start_ms": 973580, "end_ms": 974820}, {"i": 4, "text": "هَـٰذَا", "start_ms": 974820, "end_ms": 975670}, {"i": 5, "text": "فَسْـَٔلُوهُمْ", "start_ms": 975670, "end_ms": 977190}, {"i": 6, "text": "إِن", "start_ms": 977190, "end_ms": 978670}, {"i": 7, "text": "كَانُوا۟", "start_ms": 978670, "end_ms": 979570}, {"i": 8, "text": "يَنطِقُونَ", "start_ms": 979570, "end_ms": 983265}]}